<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52016" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καινόω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καινός</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make new, change</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐπιβουλεύματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					47.4
				</span></i>
			; of language, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Th.</u>
				21
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, of political changes, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.71
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καινοῦσθαι τὰς διανοίας</span>
			in <i>inventing new</i> devices, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.82
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.326
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.156
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καινίζω</span>
			, <i>use for the first time, handsel</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.100
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>renew</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόβον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.78
				</span></i>
			.</div>
